Local reminder. Law: `AGENTS.md`.

Call the API only through `@ysk-kit/sdk` (React Query via `@ysk-kit/web-sdk`). No raw `fetch` to kit paths. No `@prisma/client`, `@ysk-kit/db-prisma`, or `apps/api/src/generated`. Do not import `@ysk-kit/observability`.
